{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>英國前球星碧咸（David Beckham）大仔布魯克林（Brooklyn）與美國豪門女星妻子妮歌娜佩絲（Nicola Peltz）於社交網站分享萬聖節扮相，分別扮成DC超級英雄「超人」與反派「貓女」，於派對中親熱合照，布魯克林抱住單腳企的妮歌娜，更情深一吻，不過咀嘴相被模糊處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:21:04.144326+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:54:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:58:41.133812+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:12.920983+00:00","content_hash":"b227e28da5baf0bd923db3315ad018608310060518c989a507c1efa050417dd4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:21:04.144326+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}